ror.\n- **Delivery packet discrepancy:** walking the phase durations (Discovery 3, Build 6, QA 4, Release 1 business day, each next phase starting the following business day) from the 2026-10-05 start, and excluding weekends plus the 2026-10-12 company holiday, the Release phase ends 2026-10-23 — one business day after the 2026-10-22 launch date stated in the packet. The stated date appears to match the QA phase's end rather than the Release phase's end. This brief uses the recomputed date (2026-10-23); delivery should confirm whether Release was inadvertently dropped from the stated calculation.\n- **Security figures were internally consistent:** 76 of 80 incidents resolved computes to exactly 95.0%, matching the packet's stated rate — no escalation needed there.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1366,"cache_read_input_tokens":36139,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1366},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"825f8acf-5d99-4023-aa61-7cb998a64daf","uuid":"278c1aa6-012c-4cd5-922d-ef0d89cb3b29","timestamp":"2026-08-22T06:48:12.030Z","request_id":"req_011CeHLdiKbv3R6B1JT1hG9d"}
